{"hero2_ger" "The Brandenburger are an elite squad of the Wehrmacht and are adept at directly engaging enemies, but they are also taught how to operate behind the enemy front lines. They are tough and experienced, ready to prove themselves if used wisely. Use them strategically to find and exploit the enemies' weak spots."}
{"hero3_ger" "The Goliath or SdKfz 303 is a small, remote controlled tank that can carry up to 100kg of explosives. This masterpiece of German engineering is combined with a horrendous amount of explosives, making it one of the deadliest weapons in your arsenal! However, due to its weak protection, it's best when deployed in ambushes or cover."}
{"hero4_ger" "The Fallschirmjager are the most experienced paratrooper units that Germany has to offer. Arriving in a half-track, they possess the speed and mobility that fits them to be the spearhead of your troops. Equipped with the some of the best weapons available, they will fight to the bitter end, be it victory or death."}
{"hero5_ger" "The Radio Operator is a specially trained infantryman capable of calling in precise artillery strikes with his signal flares. A trained artillery observer awaits in the rear, ready at a moments' notice to direct fire down onto any signals he sees. The Radio Operator's unique abilities make him valuable, and special care should be taken to keep him from harm."}
{"hero6_ger" "The StuH 42 is the most powerful unit available for breaking through enemy lines. The StuH 42 assault tank with a 105mm gun breaks through any obstacles and Panzergrenadiere provide supporting fire. Each soldier is armed with Panzerfausts or StG44, enabling them to deal with any and all armored targets they might encounter. These troops will leave nothing standing in the wake of their destruction!"}
{"hero7_ger" "Two Sd.Kfz 251/1 halftracks each carrying a squad of Sturmpioneers supported by a pair of of Nebelwerfer 41s loaded with smoke rockets."}
{"hero8_ger" "The Veteran Tiger is a Tiger heavy tank with 230 range, manned by a battle-hardened crew. The crew of this vehicle are veterans of many battles and work together like a well-oiled machine. This is the best Germany has to offer. Strike fear into the very heart of our enemies with our most fearsome tank -- let nothing stand in your way!"}
{"hero9_ger" "The Sturmtiger is our most powerful assault gun. Equipped with a 380mm rocket mortar, it has the power to stop anything our enemy throws at us, and can eliminate even the strongest enemy fortifications. However, preparing the gun for fire is a lengthy process. Keep the Sturmtiger out of harm's way until it is ready to fire, and then unleash the full force of this powerful weapon!"}
{"heronew1_ger" "The Panzerfaust Squad is equipped with a disposable preloaded tube capable of firing an anti-tank warhead. In the hands of our veterans, these recoilless weapons are highly effective against all types of armored vehicles and will stop our enemies dead in their tracks!"}
{"heronew2_ger" "The Marder III Ausf. M is a self-propelled anti-tank vehicle equipped with the 75mm PaK 40. Based on the Panzer 38(t) Ausf. H. chassis, these powerful tank destroyers are well armed, but thinly armored. A perfect tool to lure our enemies into an ambush worth our fatherland!"}
{"heronew3_ger" "The PaK 44 is an 128mm anti-tank gun developed to penetrate the heaviest of Allied tanks, including the American M26 Pershing, British Churchill Mk. VIII and the Soviet IS-2. A highly effective weapon, it is easily considered one of the best anti-tank weapons our superior German engineers have created so far!"}
{"hero1_jap" "The AT-Riflegrenade Squad is our glorious answer to enemy armored support. By utilizing a 40mm at-grenade, it can easily penetrate light to medium armored targets at range. This ability allows our infantry to deliver supporting anti-tank fire anywhere on the battlefield and shall prove invaluable. However, it requires a strong, skillful soldier to effectively handle this weapon, so utilize these men carefully."}
{"hero2_jap" "The Kamikaze are soldiers willing to sacrifice their own life in return for that of their enemy. Valuing honour and loyalty above all else, they are ready to lay down their lives for the cause: defeating the enemy in service to the Emperor. Our enemies may have stronger tanks and better technology, but without the true warrior spirit, they have no chance of to defeat us! BANZAI!!"}
{"hero3_jap" "The Homeland Fury is what makes us different from our dishonourable enemies! Our soldiers take to the battlefield with the firepower to combat hordes of enemy infantry. Fight back the enemy at all costs, and serve your homeland with loyalty and honour!"}
{"hero4_jap" "The Marine Paratroopers are well-trained and highly skilled troops -- the best that we have to offer. Arriving in a half-track, they possess the speed and mobility that allows them to be the spearhead of your troops. Fighting with a warrior spirit unmatched by the enemy, they go above and beyond the call of duty, battling their foe and capturing vital positions."}
{"hero5_jap" "The Radio Operator is a special trained infantryman capable of calling in precise artillery strikes with his signal flares. A trained artillery observer awaits in the rear, ready at a moments' notice to direct fire down onto any signals he sees. The Radio Operator's unique abilities make him valuable, and special care should be taken to keep him from harm."}
{"hero6_jap" "Japanese medium tank platton armed with 5 Chi He"}
{"hero7_jap" "The 200mm Rocket is our newest piece of artillery. This massive rocket mortar can cause death and destruction to rain down upon our enemies, while maintaining a safe distance. It is highly volatile, so keep it out of the line of fire and it will help you pound your enemies into submission!"}
{"hero8_jap" "The Marine Tank is equipped with a powerful 120mm naval gun. What it lacks in armor, it makes up for in firepower. Its gun is capable of wreaking wide-spread destruction, providing the fire support needed to soften the enemy defenses and allow us to break through enemy lines!"}
{"hero9_jap" "The Ho-Ri 1 is our latest tank destroyer, based on a German design and armed with the 105mm Type 5 Kai. With power enough to bring down all but the toughest of enemy armored units, the Ho-Ri is truly a force to be reckoned with. At last, we have the capacity to instil fear into the hearts of all enemy tankers! Enemy armor will be rendered useless, and the tide of battle will turn in our favour, once and for all!"}
{"heronew1_jap" "The SS-Bo-Gata Flame Tank is light designed to be the dragon of the Japanese Army. Capable of dispensing fire from an impressive five flamethrowers this tank can saturate an entire combat zone. It is the perfect weapon to instill fear and drive our enemy back from our shores."}
{"heronew2_jap" "The Ho-Ni 3 is a completely enclosed self-propelled tank destroyer armed with a 75mm cannon. By completely encasing the cabin with armor, it offers our troops better protection against small arms and grenades. Designed to protect the home islands, our Ho-Ni 3 offers tremendous anti-tank support."}
{"heronew3_jap" "The Type 97 Mortar is a heavy emplacement capable of raining down 150mm shells. This weapon can quickly dispatch even the toughest of infantry, killing entire squads with a single shell, but retaining a solid rate of fire. This weaponry will shatter our enemies morale!"}
{"hero1_eng" "The Saboteur is one of the finest commandos Britain can offer. He specializes in infiltration and sabotage, working behind enemy lines to subvert the enemy. This is the unit of choice to create havoc and eliminate key assets behind enemy lines. Go low and slow, use his additional stealth carefully and he will perform admirably for King and country."}
{"hero2_eng" "The Royal Engineers are the most skilled engineers in the Commonwealth. Coming from Canada, they serve the Commonwealth with dedication, and come with all the tools necessary to create heavily fortified positions with hedgehogs, barbed wire, sandbags and mines. These engineers are the perfect choice to entrench a valuable position and thwart enemy attacks."}
{"hero3_eng" "This highly decorated division served longer in frontline combat than any other Australian division. It fought in campaigns in North Africa, Greece, and Syria before returning to fight the Japanese in New Guinea and Borneo."}
{"hero4_eng" "The Royal Commandos are the most experienced commando units of the Commonwealth. Arriving in a half-track, they possess the speed and mobility that will allow them to be the spearhead of your troops. By deploying the mines with which they are equipped, these chaps can prevent the enemy from re-taking their lost ground."}
{"hero5_eng" "The Radio Operator is a specially trained infantryman, capable of calling in precise artillery strikes with his signal flares. A trained artillery observer awaits in the rear, ready at a moments' notice to direct fire down onto any signals he sees. The Radio Operator's unique abilities make him valuable, and special care should be taken to keep him from harm."}
{"hero6_eng" "The Churchill Crocodile is a Churchill Mk. VII variant which introduces a devastating flamethrower in place of the bow mounted hull machine-gun. With the Churchill's already substantial armor and 75mm gun, the addition of a flamethrower makes it perfectly suited for close-quarter and urban fighting. Torch enemy-occupied buildings to the ground, leaving no cover for escape -- but beware of enemy anti-tank assets, you don't want to lose this valuable unit to a hidden enemy!"}
{"hero7_eng" "The Royal Artillery deploys a pair of 25pdr medium field howitzers under your command. Working in tandem, they can quickly inflict massive damage on your enemies, provided they have clear firing lines and visible targets. Unleashing their firepower on an unsuspecting enemy can quickly tear up enemy infantry formations and turn the tide of battle. Keep them out of the line of fire and they'll serve you well."}
{"hero8_eng" "The Churchill AVRE is a Churchill Mk. VII variant mounted with a 290mm petard mortar. What it lacks in range, it makes up for in firepower. The incredible destructive force of the 290mm mortar can shred anything used for cover by the enemy, and even inflicts damage upon armored targets. Though it is well protected by the armor which the Churchill chassis provides, it nevertheless takes significant time to reload the mortar, so don't leave it in the line of fire unnecessarily!"}
{"hero9_eng" "The Black Prince is based on the Churchill chassis but has had its armament improved with the inclusion of the deadly 17pdr gun. With its superior armor, and boasting one of the best guns of the war, the Black Prince is perfectly suited to tackle enemy armor and is built to match all but the very best the enemy has to offer. Use it to engage and destroy armor, and to drive your enemy from the field of battle before your tea gets cold!"}
{"heronew1_eng" "The Canadian Black Watch are a veteran combat battalion used famously in the Battle of the Scheldt. This unit suffered horrondous combat losses, but distinguished itself as a fearsome fighting unit. The heroic and gallant men of the Canadian Black Watch are the perfect addition to any Commonwealth army."}
{"heronew2_eng" "The Cromwell Mk. VI is armed with a deadly 95mm howitzer designed for infantry support. The howitzer gun allows this vehicle to arch high explosive projectiles at targets while keeping the crew and the vehicle at safe combat distances. This variant retains the speed of its predecessor, but offers the firepower needed to destroy large emplacements and concentrated infantry."}
{"heronew3_eng" "The M4A4 Tulip  is modified with rails attached to either side of the turret and designed to launch 3 inch rockets. The system is capable of firing two of these rockets and each containes a 60 pound warhead. This variant has the ability to produce devastating results and inflict horrendous causalities to our enemies!"}
{"hero1_rus" "The Spetsnaz is one of our toughest soldiers, trained for months under the very harshest conditions our Motherland can provide. Equipped with all possible means of destruction, this soldier is best used behind the occupiers front lines, where he can inflict massive damage to the unsuspecting enemy. Keep low and go slow -- use his additional stealth carefully and he will pay for himself many times over."}
{"hero2_rus" "The Guards Riflemen are honourable comrades who have proven themselves many times on the battlefield! Armed with light machine guns and anti-tank rifles, they have the power to stop infantry and light armor alike. This combination makes them a team well suited to deal with a range of threats, so use them wisely!"}
{"hero3_rus" "The Guards Snipers are our best snipers, trained to hunt down enemy sharpshooters and high ranking enemy officers. Working together, they can quickly eliminate enemy infantry from an area. They can be stealthy when needed, and can keep tabs on the enemy using their rifle scopes. Where possible, use them to take out important enemy targets such as officers, or weapon crews, allowing your forces to sweep in and overrun the enemy once they have been weakened!"}
{"hero4_rus" "The Black Coats, also known as the Black Deaths to our enemies! The cream of our marines, these soldiers are armed to the teeth and will stop at nothing to serve their country. Arriving in a half-track, they possess the speed and mobility to make them the optimal spearhead of your troops. Push back the enemy and reclaim our territory for Mother Russia!"}
{"hero5_rus" "The Charge! attack is a attempt to overwhelm the enemy with sheer numeric force. Comrade -- these soldiers are laying down their lives for the Motherland, and there is no finer patriotic service than this!"}
{"hero6_rus" "The Radio Operator is a special trained infantryman capable of calling in precise artillery strikes with his signal flares. A trained artillery observer awaits in the rear, ready at a moments' notice to direct fire down onto any signals he sees. The Radio Operator's unique abilities make him valuable, and special care should be taken to keep him from harm."}
{"hero7_rus" "The Assault Troops are trained not to leave the tanks until they are under fire. Riding into battle on our OT-34 tanks, this force is well-equipped to deal with any threat. The accompanying infantry is trained to create a screen to defend the tanks from enemy infantry, while the tank takes on and eliminates any armored opposition. This well-rounded and diverse force will be able to turn back any attacker and seize victory for the Motherland!"}
{"hero8_rus" "The KV-2 heavy assault tanks are named after our comrade, Commissar Kliment Voroshilov, and each one is sponsored by a Russian village. While it is well-armored, it is the force of arms this vehicle possesses that teaches our enemies to quake at its approach: equipped with a 152mm howitzer, this tank can destroy anything but the heaviest of enemy targets. Once the KV-2 rolls onto the battlefield, retreat will be our enemies' only option!"}
{"hero9_rus" "The Stalin's Sledgehammers are two 203mm B-4M super-heavy howitzers. The 203mm B-4M howitzer showers massive destructive force upon your terrified enemies. This 203mm artillery piece is equipped to destroy just about any enemy unit, and can cause even the heaviest of enemy defenses to crumble. Designed to perform these tasks while maintaining a safe distance, it is important to keep this piece of artillery out of the line of fire. Clear a path for your tanks and troops, and lead the Soviet army to victory!"}
{"heronew1_rus" "The Shock Infantry resemble some of the toughest soldiers offered by the Soviet Union. Shock infantry carry body armor and wield flamethrowers allowing them to assault even the toughest defensive positions. Known for their bravery and zeal these troops will help push any frontline forward."}
{"heronew2_rus" "The BS-3 is the heaviest anti-tank gun fielded by the Soviet Army. The 100mm gun penetrates even the toughest of armor and offers infantry excellent fire support. No longer will our foes dominate on the battlefield with their heavy machinery!"}
{"heronew3_rus" "The BM-8-24 is a variant of the Katyusha rocket system adapted on the T-60 chassis. The lighter 82mm BM-8 rockets are not as devestating as their heavier cousin, but offer commanders impressive fire support with their unmatched fire rate and capability to destroy the last bit of enemy morale left!"}
{"hero1_usa" "The M8 Howitzer is a 75mm light howitzer that enables us to bolster the firepower of our airborne forces. This gun is best used behind cover, where it can take advantage of its arched trajectory. Although not the most accurate weapon, it is still capable of destroying light vehicles and field fortifications. Use it to your advantage and it will serve you well."}
{"hero2_usa" "The U.S. Marines are some of the finest soldiers available. They are well-equipped with both submachine and light machine guns, ready for close combat. Their tenacious reputation in battle proves them to be the very embodiment of their motto: 'Semper Fi' -- 'always faithful'. They never waver in their unflinching defense of freedom against all foes, no matter what the odds!"}
{"hero3_usa" "The 101st Airborne are well-trained and highly skilled paratroopers. With dedication and bravery surpassing most other troops, they will stop at nothing to accomplish the task at hand. Arriving in a half-track, they possess the speed and mobility that earns them the capacity to be the spearhead of your troops. They've established a well-deserved reputation from their performance in numerous previous battles, and now they are called upon to once again uphold their reputation and fight for their country!"}
{"hero4_usa" "The M4A3R2 Croc takes the regular chassis of our M4A3 Sherman, but replaces the coaxial machine gun with a devastating flamethrower. This enables the Croc to ferret out enemy troops and torch any cover that might potentially be use to conceal them. However, it lacks any improvements in armor, so care must be taken to ensure that it does not fall victim to the enemy. Make use of its speed to keep it out of enemy sights."}
{"hero5_usa" "The Radio Operator is a special trained infantryman capable of calling in precise artillery strikes with his signal flares. A trained artillery observer awaits in the rear, ready at a moments' notice to direct fire down onto any signals he sees. The Radio Operator's unique abilities make him valuable, and special care should be taken to keep him from harm."}
{"hero6_usa" "The M4A3(105) is based on the chassis of our regular M4A3 Sherman, but comes fitted with a short-barrelled 105mm howitzer. It is capable of destroying fortified targets and softening enemy defenses from distances that greatly exceed that of than any conventional tank cannon. It is an excellent weapon for supporting our troops and can quickly reposition itself to address any new threats that might appear on the battlefield. Use it carefully and it will serve you well."}
{"hero7_usa" "The Mass Production of vehicles allows us to outnumber our enemies. While our tanks may not equal the armor and firepower of our enemies', we nevertheless make up for this technological gap by sheer power in number, which they can't hope to match. These two Sherman 76's will help you outmanoeuvre the enemy and allow you to deliver a crippling blow. Forward thrust -- let's drive them from the battlefield with our strength in numbers!"}
{"hero8_usa" "The M4A3E2(76)W Jumbo is a field modification of the regular Jumbo variant. While retaining the superb armor of the Jumbo, the 75mm M3 gun has been upgraded to the 76mm high-velocity gun. This allows the Jumbo 76 to effectively engage and destroy even the heaviest of enemy armored vehicles, while being afforded a high level of protection by the Jumbo's thick armor. Some speed is sacrificed with this combination, but it can easily turn the tide of battle when used properly."}
{"hero9_usa" "The Super Pershing is an up-gunned and up-armored variant of our M26 Pershing heavy tank. It is equipped with a long-barrelled 90mm M3 gun, which boasts armor penetration capabilities far superior to that of any other weapon in our arsenal. Fitted with additional armor plating, this tank can tackle even the heaviest of enemy vehicles. This critical piece of equipment may be just what you need to snatch victory from the jaws of defeat!"}
{"heronew1_usa" "The .30 cal Browning A6 is a light machine gun designed to be carried and operated by a single infantryman. The M1919 A6 is a significant upgrade to the BAR and vastly improves the fire support of our GIs. One step closer to liberate the world from our enemies!"}
{"heronew2_usa" "The US Combat Engineers perform a variety of construction tasks, but are specifically trained to destroy obstacles and heavy emplacements. Armed with satchel charges, usually a messanger bag filled with C-4 and a triggering mechanism, these troops often create awe-inspiring explosions exposing enemy lines."}
{"heronew3_usa" "The Devil's Brigade is an elite, joint commando unit organized by the Americans and Canadians. This unit is designed to conduct special operations behind enemy lines including eliminating specific targets, interrupting communications and raiding supply routes. These men are limited in number, but their stealth and destructive power are unmatched."}
; new
{"light_mortar_ger" "The 50mm Granatwerfer 36 was a light mortar used by Germany during World War II. It was intended to be used against targets which were beyond a hand grenade's throwing range but the weapon ended to be too complex and had neither enough range nor sufficient explosive payload."}
{"hero_mg42_ger" "A MG42 Lafette HMG operated by two veteran vehicle opearators. These well experienced troops make up the backbone of German tactics."}
{"hero10_ger" "The Pz IV. J Battle group is made up of two Panzerkampfwagen IV Ausf. J medium tanks."}
{"flak18_hero" "Two FlaK 18 artillery pieces."}
{"panther_hero" "The Veteran Panther is a 240 range PzKpfw Panther Ausf. G operated by very elite crew. These guys have read the Pantherfibel in ample detail, drawing careful attention to the naked girls inside. You can count on them to dispatch any armoured vehicle the enemy can throw at us. This vehicle makes our adversaries tremble and cry like little femboys -- as long as it frontally faces the enemy!"}
{"hero_ger_tiger2_ace" "STRENG GEHEIM! This is a top-of-the-line heavy tank, the Panzerkampfwagen VI Tiger Ausf. B 'Henschel turret', armed with a deadly 8mm KwK 43 crewed with the most experienced of all Wehrmacht tank crew. Annhilate the enemy armor in defense of the Vaterland!"}
{"hero12_ost" "The Jagdtiger is exactly what it name says. It's a tiger tank, for hunting down other tanks. The 128mm main gun makes this a beast of a tank killer. The frontal armor is almost impenetrable for most other tanks, but as with many tank destroyers, watch your tracks! "}
{"storm_mech_ost" "A mechanized squad consisting of four jaegers armed with 2 MAB 38 submachine guns, a scoped StG44, and a G43, alongside a SdKfz 250/1 halftrack armed with one MG42. These troops are dedicated towards rapid deployment and securement of a target, or to quickly break through a weak point in the enemy line."}
{"hero1_ost" "This veteran field officer is capable of supporting your troops by spotting enemy units from afar with his binoculars. Use his skill in locating enemy units through the fog of war, so that your other units can engage or avoid them as necessary. The officer also reduces your current CP by 22 which allows you to field a bigger army, and comes with four jaegers armed with StG44s as his personal bodyguards when surveying the front."}
{"hero2_ost" "An elite squad of tank hunters. Comes with two panzershreck operators and two panzershreck assistants, and works best when in concealment when an enemy tank comes too close."}
{"hero3_ost" "The SdKfz/234 3 is an armored vehicle armed with the 75mm K 51 L/24 support gun. Armed with both HE and HEAT rounds, this vehicle works best at both supporting infantry advances and destroying light emplacements and fortifications."}
{"hero4_ost" "A very large squad of 30 penal units armed with nothing but grenades, Karabiner 98ks, and MP40s, with some demo charges throughout. These troops are almost always meant to die, assaulting high-risk positions under the cover of more elite units."}
{"hero5_ost" "2 mechanized squads consisting of each a halftrack armed with a deadly 2.8cm SPzB 41 squeeze-bore gun and four jaegers that includes an MG42. These shock troops are dedicated to assaulting a position and neutralizing light vehicles along the way."}
{"hero6_ost" "The SdKfz 234/4 is an armored car equipped with the 7.5cm PaK 40 anti-tank cannon in addition to an auxiliary MG-34. Use this special vehicle to ambush valuable enemy assets before retreating to a new position."}
{"hero7_ost" "The radio operator is a valuable asset, allowing for the use of off-screen mortars to suppress a targeted area using his signal gun. He comes with six deployable flares in addition to an escort of two jaegers armed with MP40s."}
{"hero8_ost" "This captured T-34-85 has been requisitioned by German forces for redeployment on the Eastern Front. Crewed by veteran tankmen, it also includes a complement of four jaegers as infantry support."}
{"hero_ost_stug" "This StuG III Ausf. G is crewed by elite tankmen; thanks to their veterancy, such a vehicle is perfect for quickly and effectively ambushing enemy vehicles from a longer range than what most normal StuG IIIs normally engage at."}
{"hero10_ost" "The SdKfz 8 Flak 37 carries the mighty 8.8cm FlaK 37, well equipped to destroy all but the heaviest of enemy vehicles."}
{"hero9_ost" "The Schweres Wurfgerat 41 is a multiple rocket launcher that sends six devastating 28/32 cm high explosive or incendiary rockets at the enemy. It is a great weapon to harm both vehicles and fortifications, but must be kept guarded due to being deployed by infantry."}
{"hero11_ost" "The Sturmpanzer IV is a heavy self-propelled gun armed with the 15cm StuH 43 L/12 cannon and staffed with an elite tank crew. With its high explosive shells, the Brummbar will be able to wreak havoc on the most fortified of positions and many heavy vehicles."}
{"hero_jap_chi_to" "This Chi-To and its 75mm Type 5 gun arrive to the battlefield with a sizeable stock of experimental Otsu APCR ammunition. Counter enemy armor quickly and effectively with this shell-tank combination!"}
{"hero_jap_elite_aa" "These twin elite 75mm Type 4 guns are equipped with experimental Otsu APCR ammunition, and are able to deal with enemy armor up to the maximum range. When used effectively, they can hamper any enemy armored advance and even kill some of the heaviest enemy tanks!"}
{"hero_dual_type41" "A detachment of a 75mm pack artillery battery is ready to provide fire support. Two guns with WP, HE, HEAT, and AP will be provided."}
{"otsu-gata_koho" "Otsu-gata composite defensive engineers, capable of creating concealed, fortified, and infiltration structures."}
{"ki-gata_koho" "Ki-gata composite tank assault engineers, equipped with demolition charges and long ranged smoke candles."}
{"super_officer_jap" "Senior officer with 30cp reduction; keep safe to retain CP benefits."}
{"hero_guard_lend_lease_apc" "A universal carrier APC supplied by the Commonwealth, we have armed it with a PTRS in place of the Bren"}
{"light_mortar_eng" "The 2-inch Mk.II mortar was a light mortar used by the Commonwealth during World War II. It was intended to be used against targets which were beyond a hand grenade's throwing range. It was fairly effective in its role, only hampered by short range."}
{"hero_eng_wasp" "A Universal Carrier with a Ronson flamethrower fitted. This vehicle is a perfect asset when you have too much of the enemy existing in one place and you want to change that situation."}
{"hero_firefly_eng" "The M4A4 Firefly is a modified US Sherman tank with a 17-pounder gun that can take on all but the heaviest of axis armor."}
{"hero_ss_sniper" "The Veteran Sniper is a well-trained and highly skilled marksman. His deeds in service to the Fatherland are numerous and have earned him many awards. This long and distinguished service has made him a valued figure in the Wehrmacht and he now serves his country by passing on his knowledge to new soldiers. However, in urgent situations this highly experienced officer won't hesitate to serve his Fatherland on the front lines!"}
{"hero_ss_2cmflak" "The Mechanized 20mm FlaK 38 is a 20mm Flak 38 AA gun towed by a SdKfz 251/1 halftrack."}
{"hero_ss_stuka" "The SdKfz 251/1 Wurfrahmen 40 'Stuka zu Fuss' is a SdKfz 251/1 halftrack with 280/320mm rockets."}
{"hero_ss_hetzers" "The Jagdpanzer 38(t) Hetzer battlegroup is two Jagdpanzer 38(t) Hetzers."}
{"hero_ss_pak40" "The Mechanized 75mm PaK 40 platoon is three PaK 40 AT guns towed by SdKfz 8s."}
{"hero_ss_lefh18" "Two LeFH 18 105mm howitzers. Good for blowing stuff up, less good for getting blown up."}
{"hero_ss_brummbar" "The Sturmpanzer IV 'Brummbar' is a Heavy assault tank with heavy armor and armed with a 15cm howitzer."}
{"tiger_ace" "The Tiger Ace is a PzKpfw Tiger Ausf. E with a ace crew."}
{"hero_ss_jagdpanther" "The Jagdpanther is a heavy tank destroyer with heavy sloped armor and armed with the PaK 43 L/71 gun."}
{"hero_ss_das_reich" "A Sdfkz 251/1 filled with a squadron of veteran Panzergrenadiers from the 'Das Reich' division."}
{"hero_ss_17cm_kanone" "The 17cm Kanone has the ability to strike enemy guns with impunity while offering greater reload capability than the Morser."}
{"hero_rus_at_squad" "A detachment of PTR anti tank riflemen. Two veterans armed with PTRS, a singular regular PTRD, and an assistant. 6 skill for the former. 3 skill for the two latter."}
{"hero_rus_isu152" "The ISU-122 tank destroyers are powerfull units. While it is well-armored, it is the force of arms this vehicle possesses that teaches our enemies to quake at its approach: equipped with a 122mm cannon, this tank can destroy anything but the heaviest of enemy targets. Once the ISU-122 rolls onto the battlefield, retreat will be our enemies' only option!"}
{"hero_t34platoon" "The T-34-76 Platoon consists of three T-34-76 mod. 1943 medium tanks."}
{"hero_orgel" "The Stalin's Organ consists of a BM-13 Katyusha rocket truck."}
{"hero_stalins_gamble" "A recon section of light armor has been rushed forward at maximum speed to provide shock and awe on initial contact."}
{"hero10_usa" "The Support weapon platoon includes two M1 Mortars, one Browning 30.cal HMG and two M1 57mm Anti-tank guns."}
{"m7_hero" "Two M7 Priest 105mm artillery tanks. Best used as paratrooper magnet."}
{"fury_hero" "The M4A3E8(76)W Fury is manned by an elite crew, giving it increased rate of fire, better overall mobility and carries a few special rounds of ammunition."}
{"hero_usa_m36" "A 90mm GMC M36 Slugger. Armed by a veteran crew, this vehicle can dispose of all but the heaviest of the enemy armour."}
{"pershing_hero" "A really veteran M26 Pershing heavy tank. It's like the Slugger but it can tank a shot or two."}
{"hero_usa_m12" "One 155mm GMC M12 artillery tank. These battle-hardened artillery crew can provide precise and fast fire support to any location you desire. They are loyal to you and will strike the enemy accurately as long as you provide them with ample amounts of ammo."}
{"hero_usa_m1_57mm_drop" "An air dropped M1_57mm AT gun with two veteran partroopers to arm it."}
{"hero_usa_raiders" "An elite mechanized detachment with two LVT4-A armed with 75mm howitzers and multiple machine guns each of these have a squad of elite marine raiders. Skill 5 except for the SL and SA at 6 skill"}
{"hero_usa_log" "US logistics in full sprint to maximize material advantge; one heavy ammo crate, one infantry ammo crate, and one normal GMC Truck. You had horses, what were you thinking!"}
